  "change_note": "Desktop pairs merged Core main #223–#232 and #234–#240 at Pi/PiDurable 1.0.2. Runtime and Bridge schemas, both component manifests and reviewed closure are pinned together. Bridge v1.1, occurrence v1.2 and 12 public bridge commands remain unchanged. New G1 source-preview/review stays an explicit teacher-selected DOCX fragment workflow; a parsed fragment is not approval. Planning read views do not spend decision history and duplicate decision rows are omitted without rewriting history; selected material/source basis is strict and stale changes remain held. Core retains sole authority over Durable recovery, natural intake, material schedules and bounded method recall. G2/G3/G4 Live remain off by default; G5 and unverified guardian/material/term attribution are not promoted. external_send=false. Source pairing does not constitute installation verification."
